    "Id": "mechdef_aries_ARS-C_II",
    "Name": "Aries C II",
    "Details": "Configuration C II includes Large Pulse Lasers mounted on the left arm, right arm, and center torso, providing balanced energy firepower. Ultra AC/20 autocannons are installed on both left and right torsos, supported by ample ammo distributed across arms and torsos for sustained ballistic attacks. This setup focuses on heavy, versatile firepower with a mix of energy and ballistic weapons, delivering strong mid-range and close combat capabilities. Cooling is maintained by 18 double heat sinks to handle heat buildup during intense firefights.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Multi Trac</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.19</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#0064e6>Used with permission from Aries Games and Miniatures.</color></b>",
